{"seq":2,"slug":"context-aware-generation","title":"上下文感知的代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-autonomous-coding/intelligent-coding-workflows/context-aware-generation","wordCount":2424,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文感知的代码生成\">上下文感知的代码生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上下文感知是区分&quot;AI 补全片段&quot;和&quot;AI 理解项目后生成&quot;的分水岭。一个没有项目上下文的模型，生成的代码可能语法正确但与项目风格冲突、引入不存在的依赖、或者重复实现已有的工具函数。上下文感知的代码生成要求 Agent 在写下每一行代码之前，已经建立了对项目架构、编码规范、类型系统和依赖关系的全局理解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;上下文构建&quot;&#10;        A[代码库索引] --&gt; B[嵌入向量]&#10;        C[AST 解析] --&gt; D[符号图]&#10;        E[类型系统] --&gt; F[接口/类型表]&#10;        G[配置文件] --&gt; H[项目元数据]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;上下文检索&quot;&#10;        I[生成请求] --&gt; J[相关性搜索]&#10;        J --&gt; B&#10;        J --&gt; D&#10;        J --&gt; F&#10;        J --&gt; H&#10;        J --&gt; K[上下文窗口]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;感知生成&quot;&#10;        K --&gt; L[LLM 生成]&#10;        L --&gt; M[生成代码]&#10;        M --&gt; N[一致性验证]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"上下文构建\"\n        A[代码库索引] --&gt; B[嵌入向量]\n        C[AST 解析] --&gt; D[符号图]\n        E[类型系统] --&gt; F[接口/类型表]\n        G[配置文件] --&gt; H[项目元数据]\n    end\n    subgraph \"上下文检索\"\n        I[生成请求] --&gt; J[相关性搜索]\n        J --&gt; B\n        J --&gt; D\n        J --&gt; F\n        J --&gt; H\n        J --&gt; K[上下文窗口]\n    end\n    subgraph \"感知生成\"\n        K --&gt; L[LLM 生成]\n        L --&gt; M[生成代码]\n        M --&gt; N[一致性验证]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>上下文类型</th>\n<th>信息内容</th>\n<th>获取方式</th>\n<th>对生成质量的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目结构</td>\n<td>目录布局、模块边界</td>\n<td>文件系统扫描</td>\n<td>生成文件放置在正确位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>接口、类型别名、泛型约束</td>\n<td>tsc/LSP 分析</td>\n<td>参数类型和返回类型正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码规范</td>\n<td>命名风格、导入顺序、模式偏好</td>\n<td>AST 统计分析</td>\n<td>风格与项目一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖关系</td>\n<td>已安装包、内部模块导出</td>\n<td>package.json + import 分析</td>\n<td>不引入幻觉依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务语义</td>\n<td>领域模型、API 契约</td>\n<td>文档/注释/Schema 分析</td>\n<td>业务逻辑正确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码库索引技术\">代码库索引技术</h2><p>代码库索引是上下文感知的基础设施。它的目标是将整个代码库的信息组织成 Agent 可以快速查询的结构，使 Agent 在需要特定上下文时能够精确获取，而不是将整个代码库塞入上下文窗口。</p>\n<p><strong>文本嵌入索引</strong>是最通用的方案。将代码文件按函数/类粒度分割为片段（chunk），使用嵌入模型（如 OpenAI text-embedding-3-small、Voyage Code）将每个片段转化为向量，存储在向量数据库中。当 Agent 需要查找相关代码时，用自然语言查询检索最相似的片段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CodebaseIndex {&#10;  chunks: CodeChunk[];&#10;  embeddings: Float32Array[];&#10;  metadata: ChunkMetadata[];&#10;&#10;  search(query: string, topK: number): Promise&lt;SearchResult[]&gt;;&#10;  reindex(changedFiles: string[]): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CodeChunk {&#10;  filePath: string;&#10;  startLine: number;&#10;  endLine: number;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  symbolName: string | null;&#10;  symbolType: &#39;function&#39; | &#39;class&#39; | &#39;interface&#39; | &#39;module&#39; | &#39;other&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SearchResult {&#10;  chunk: CodeChunk;&#10;  score: number;&#10;  context: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodebaseIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  chunks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  embeddings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChunkMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SearchResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">changedFiles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  symbolName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  symbolType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'function'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'class'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'interface'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'module'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'other'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  chunk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>AST 索引</strong>提供比文本嵌入更精确的结构化查询能力。通过解析代码的抽象语法树，Agent 可以查询&quot;所有实现了 Handler 接口的类&quot;、&quot;调用了 database.query 的函数&quot;等结构化问题。AST 索引的构建依赖语言特定的解析器（如 TypeScript 的 ts-morph、Python 的 ast 模块）。</p>\n<p>**符号图（Symbol Graph）**将代码库中的符号（函数、类、变量、类型）及其关系（调用、继承、导入）建模为图结构。符号图支持回答&quot;这个函数被谁调用&quot;、&quot;这个类型在哪里被使用&quot;等关系查询，是上下文检索中最有价值的信息源之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>构建成本</th>\n<th>查询精度</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>适用查询</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本嵌入</td>\n<td>中（需调用嵌入 API）</td>\n<td>中（语义模糊匹配）</td>\n<td>低（增量更新）</td>\n<td>&quot;查找处理用户认证的代码&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AST 索引</td>\n<td>低（本地解析）</td>\n<td>高（结构化精确匹配）</td>\n<td>中（语法树重建）</td>\n<td>&quot;所有 async 函数&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号图</td>\n<td>高（需全量分析）</td>\n<td>最高（精确关系查询）</td>\n<td>高（增量更新复杂）</td>\n<td>&quot;谁调用了 validateToken&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全文搜索</td>\n<td>极低（grep/ripgrep）</td>\n<td>低（纯文本匹配）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>&quot;包含 ERROR 的日志行&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"检索增强代码生成\">检索增强代码生成</h2><p>检索增强生成（RAG）技术在代码生成领域有着特殊的应用形态。与自然语言 RAG 不同，代码 RAG 需要处理结构化更强、精确性要求更高的内容。</p>\n<p><strong>代码 RAG 的检索策略</strong>通常采用多路检索：</p>\n<p><strong>语义检索</strong>：用嵌入模型查找与当前任务语义相关的代码片段。适合&quot;查找类似功能的实现&quot;这类需求。</p>\n<p><strong>符号检索</strong>：基于类型系统和符号图查找精确的接口定义、函数签名和类型别名。适合&quot;查找 UserService 的定义和方法列表&quot;这类需求。</p>\n<p><strong>路径检索</strong>：基于文件路径模式匹配相关文件。适合&quot;查找所有路由定义文件&quot;这类需求。</p>\n<p><strong>依赖检索</strong>：基于 import/require 关系追踪依赖链。适合&quot;查找这个模块的所有依赖方&quot;这类需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiPathRetriever {&#10;  semantic: SemanticSearcher&#10;  symbol: SymbolSearcher&#10;  path: PathSearcher&#10;  dependency: DependencyTracer&#10;&#10;  async retrieve(query: RetrievalQuery): Promise&lt;RetrievalResult&gt; {&#10;    const results = await Promise.all([&#10;      this.semantic.search(query.text, query.topK),&#10;      this.symbol.search(query.symbols),&#10;      this.path.search(query.pathPatterns),&#10;      this.dependency.trace(query.entryPoints),&#10;    ])&#10;&#10;    return this.merge(results)&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RetrievalQuery {&#10;  text: string&#10;  symbols: string[]&#10;  pathPatterns: string[]&#10;  entryPoints: string[]&#10;  topK: number&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiPathRetriever</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  semantic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SemanticSearcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SymbolSearcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathSearcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dependency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyTracer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retrieve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievalQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RetrievalResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semantic.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query.text, query.topK),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.symbol.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query.symbols),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query.pathPatterns),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dependency.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query.entryPoints),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievalQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  symbols</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pathPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entryPoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>检索结果的<strong>排序与去重</strong>也至关重要。多路检索可能返回重叠的结果，需要通过去重和重新排序来最大化信息密度。常用的策略包括：基于文件路径去重、基于内容哈希去重、基于 Reciprocal Rank Fusion（RRF）的多路结果合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文窗口管理\">上下文窗口管理</h2><p>即使有了强大的检索系统，上下文窗口的有限容量仍然是核心约束。一个 200K token 的窗口看似很大，但在实际使用中，系统 Prompt、工具定义、对话历史和已检索内容会快速消耗可用空间。上下文窗口管理的目标是在给定空间内最大化信息价值。</p>\n<p><strong>信息价值评估</strong>为每一段上下文内容分配一个&quot;价值/体积&quot;比，优先放入价值密度最高的内容。类型定义文件（如 <code>.d.ts</code>）通常价值密度最高——它们以极少的 token 提供了精确的 API 契约。相反，完整的实现文件价值密度较低——大量的逻辑细节中只有小部分与当前任务相关。</p>\n<p><strong>渐进式上下文加载</strong>分为三个阶段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>骨架阶段</strong>：加载项目结构、主要接口定义、当前文件的 import 链。这个阶段提供全局视野。</li>\n<li><strong>焦点阶段</strong>：加载与当前任务直接相关的文件内容和依赖项。这个阶段提供任务上下文。</li>\n<li><strong>细节阶段</strong>：按需加载被引用但未展开的具体实现。仅在 Agent 推理时发现信息不足时触发。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ContextBudget {&#10;  totalTokens: number;&#10;  allocated: {&#10;    system: number;&#10;    taskContext: number;&#10;    codeContext: number;&#10;    conversationHistory: number;&#10;    reserve: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function optimizeContext(budget: ContextBudget, candidates: ContextCandidate[]): ContextCandidate[] {&#10;  const sorted = candidates.sort((a, b) =&gt; b.valueDensity - a.valueDensity);&#10;  const selected: ContextCandidate[] = [];&#10;  let usedTokens = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const candidate of sorted) {&#10;    if (usedTokens + candidate.tokenCount &lt;= budget.allocated.codeContext) {&#10;      selected.push(candidate);&#10;      usedTokens += candidate.tokenCount;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return selected;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContextBudget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  allocated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    system</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    taskContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    codeContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FF